        "rules": [],
        "sciNote": "Survey design\n27\n153\nSampling\nUltimate class frequencies.\n27\n154\nUniformity trial\nStatistic\n29\n155\nSampling error\nW\nSampling with replacement\n155\nWidth of confidence interval\nSimple random sampling\nSampling without replacement 157\n156\n2\nY\nStratified random sampling\n158\nYule's coefficient of association\n160\nYield\nYule's correction of continuity\nAbout the Author\nJamal Shah is Professor of Statistics. He was born in 1964 in Mangah, District Mardan. He got his early education from Government higher secondary school Dargai Mangah district Charsadda. He did F.Sc. from Government postgraduate college Mardan, B.Sc. from Government postgraduate Jehanzeb College Saidu Sharif Swat. In 1988, from university of Peshawar, he received his M.Sc. Statistics degree and stood third in his batch.\nN\nHe started his service in December, 1988 as Lecturer in statistics from Government Khushal Khan Khattak college Akora Khattak district Nowshera. He remained chairman department of Statistics, Government postgraduate college Mansehra and Abbottabad for many years. Presently he is working as Principal, Govt. Degree college, Zaida Swabi. The author has a vast teaching experience of 30 years in the subject statistics at Inter, Bachelor and Master\nlevel.\nn\nifab.com\nرشوت لینے والا اور رشوت دینے والا دونوں جہنمی ہیں۔\n(حدیث نبوی صلى اللهم )\nزانہ\nawa\nکشور حسین شاد باد\nارض\nشاد باد\nپاکستان\nتوت اخوت عوام پائندہ تابندہ باد\nمنزلِ مُراد\nرہبر ترقی و کمال\nجانِ\nاستقبال\nذوالجلال\nlab.co\nO\nقومی\nپاک سر زمین شاد باد\nتو نِشا",
