        "theory": "10\n5\n00\n8\n7\n12\n74\n10\n13\n14\n11\n9\n12\nWES\n14\nA test was given to 5 students chosen at random from the first year statistics class. each of the three colleges in Peshawar. Their scores were found as follow.\nA\n50\n80\n90\n90\n70\n60\nB\n40\nC\n20\n50\n50\n70\n40\n50\n70\n60\n60\n50\n60\nn\nPerform analysis of variance and show if there is any significant difference among the score of students in the three colleges. Use a=0.05\n9,20 Test the hypothesis that no differences exist among the four treatments at t=0.05.\nSample 1\nSample 2\nSample 3\nSample 4\nilabory\n3\n11\n18\n8\n14\n=\n27\n9.21\nGiven the following data obtained from a completely randomized design with\nfour treatments;\nXi\nX\n石\nX\n12.4\n14.4\n10.2\n6.1\n20.9\n9.0\n13.2\n5.8\n10.1\n23.7\n5.1\n4.8\n4.2\n1.5\n9.22\nAnalyse the given data and draw conclusion about the equality of treatment effects. Use a=0.05\nThe following data were obtained by using completely randomized design\nSample 1\n8\n10\nSample 2",
