     "urdu": "$$\\int_x f(x)\\,dx=\\int_{0}^{1}2x\\,dx=2\\int_{0}^{1}x\\,dx=2\\left.\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right|_{0}^{1}=\\left.x^2\\right|_{0}^{1}=1-0=1=R.H.S$$",
     "pashto": "$$\\int_x f(x)\\,dx=\\int_{0}^{1}2x\\,dx=2\\int_{0}^{1}x\\,dx=2\\left.\\frac{x^2}{2}\\right|_{0}^{1}=\\left.x^2\\right|_{0}^{1}=1-0=1=R.H.S$$"
