   "theory": "Solution:\n\n(i)\\quad E(X)=\\int_x x\\,f(x)\\,dx=\\int_{0}^{1}x(2-2x)\\,dx=\\int_{0}^{1}(2x-2x^2)\\,dx\n\n=\\int_{0}^{1}2x\\,dx-\\int_{0}^{1}2x^2\\,dx=2\\int_{0}^{1}x\\,dx-2\\int_{0}^{1}x^2dx\n\n=\\left.x^2\\right|_{0}^{1}-2\\left.\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right|_{0}^{1}\n\n=(1-0)-\\left(\\frac{2}{3}-0\\right)=1-\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{3-2}{3}=\\frac{1}{3}\n\n(ii)\\quad E(X^2)=\\int_x x^2f(x)\\,dx=\\int_{0}^{1}x^2(2-2x)\\,dx=\\int_{0}^{1}(2x^2-2x^3)\\,dx\n\n=2\\int_{0}^{1}x^2dx-2\\int_{0}^{1}x^3dx=2\\left(\\left.\\frac{x^3}{3}\\right|_{0}^{1}\\right)-2\\left(\\left.\\frac{x^4}{4}\\right|_{0}^{1}\\right)\n\n=2\\left(\\frac{1}{3}-0\\right)-2\\left(\\frac{1}{4}-0\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{4-3}{6}=\\frac{1}{6}\n\n(iii) E(2X)=2E(X), (By property)\n\n=2(1/3)=2/3\n\n(iv)\\quad E(2X-1)=2E(X)-1=2\\left(\\tfrac{1}{3}\\right)-1=-1/3\n\n(v)\\quad\\text{Variance}=V(X)=E(X^2)-[E(X)]^2\n\n=\\frac{1}{6}-\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^2=\\frac{1}{6}-\\frac{1}{9}=\\frac{3-2}{18}=\\frac{1}{18}=0.056\n\nS.D(X)=\\sqrt{0.056}=0.24",
