     "text": "$$p(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}{}^{6}_{x}C(0.75)^x(0.25)^{6-x}, & x=0,1,2,3,4,5,6\\\\ 0, & \\textit{otherwise}\\end{matrix}\\right.$$",
     "urdu": "$$p(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}{}^{6}_{x}C(0.75)^x(0.25)^{6-x}, & x=0,1,2,3,4,5,6\\\\ 0, & \\textit{otherwise}\\end{matrix}\\right.$$",
     "pashto": "$$p(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}{}^{6}_{x}C(0.75)^x(0.25)^{6-x}, & x=0,1,2,3,4,5,6\\\\ 0, & \\textit{otherwise}\\end{matrix}\\right.$$"
