     "urdu": "$(iii)\\quad P(X<4)={}^{6}_{0}C(0.75)^0(0.25)^{6-0}+{}^{6}_{1}C(0.75)^1(0.25)^{6-1}+{}^{6}_{2}C(0.75)^2(0.25)^{6-2}+$",
