   "id": "stat12-p049-examples-3-13-3-14",
   "title": "Examples 3.13–3.14 — binomial mean and variance",
   "headingUrdu": "مثالیں 3.13–3.14 — دو رقمی اوسط اور تغیر",
   "headingPashto": "بېلګې 3.13–3.14 — بینومیل منځنی او واریانس",
   "paras": [
    {
     "text": "Example 3.13",
     "urdu": "مثال 3.13",
     "pashto": "بېلګه 3.13"
    },
    {
     "text": "Find the mean, variance and standard deviation of the Binomial distribution whose parameters are n = 20 and $p=\\frac{3}{5}$.",
     "urdu": "اس دو رقمی تقسیم کا اوسط، تغیر اور معیاری انحراف معلوم کریں جس کے پیرامیٹر n = 20 اور $p=\\frac{3}{5}$ ہیں۔",
     "pashto": "د هغه بینومیل وېش منځنی، واریانس او معیاري انحراف پیدا کړئ چې پارامټرونه یې n = 20 او $p=\\frac{3}{5}$ دي."
    },
    {
     "text": "Solution:",
     "urdu": "حل:",
     "pashto": "حل:"
    },
    {
     "text": "We have $n=20$, $p=\\frac{3}{5}$, $q=\\frac{2}{5}$, therefore,",
     "urdu": "ہمارے پاس $n=20$، $p=\\frac{3}{5}$، $q=\\frac{2}{5}$ ہیں، لہٰذا",
     "pashto": "موږ لرو $n=20$، $p=\\frac{3}{5}$، $q=\\frac{2}{5}$، نو"
    },
    {
     "text": "$\\text{Mean}=np=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}=12$",
     "urdu": "$\\text{Mean}=np=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}=12$",
     "pashto": "$\\text{Mean}=np=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}=12$"
    },
    {
     "text": "$\\text{Variance}=npq=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}\\times\\frac{2}{5}=4.8$",
     "urdu": "$\\text{Variance}=npq=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}\\times\\frac{2}{5}=4.8$",
     "pashto": "$\\text{Variance}=npq=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}\\times\\frac{2}{5}=4.8$"
    },
    {
     "text": "$S.D(X)=\\sqrt{npq}=\\sqrt{4.8}=2.19$",
     "urdu": "$S.D(X)=\\sqrt{npq}=\\sqrt{4.8}=2.19$",
     "pashto": "$S.D(X)=\\sqrt{npq}=\\sqrt{4.8}=2.19$"
    },
    {
     "text": "Example 3.14",
     "urdu": "مثال 3.14",
     "pashto": "بېلګه 3.14"
    },
    {
     "text": "If n = 4, $p=\\frac{1}{3}$, find (i) the complete Binomial probability distribution. (ii) mean and variance of this distribution. (iii) calculate the mean and variance using properties and compare the results.",
     "urdu": "اگر n = 4، $p=\\frac{1}{3}$ ہو تو معلوم کریں (i) مکمل دو رقمی احتمالی تقسیم۔ (ii) اس تقسیم کا اوسط اور تغیر۔ (iii) خصوصیات کی مدد سے اوسط اور تغیر معلوم کریں اور نتائج کا موازنہ کریں۔",
     "pashto": "که n = 4، $p=\\frac{1}{3}$ وي، پیدا کړئ (i) بشپړ بینومیل احتمالي وېش. (ii) د دې وېش منځنی او واریانس. (iii) د ځانګړنو په کارولو سره منځنی او واریانس محاسبه کړئ او پایلې پرتله کړئ."
    },
    {
     "text": "Solution:",
     "urdu": "حل:",
     "pashto": "حل:"
    },
    {
     "text": "(i) Here $p=\\frac{1}{3}$, $q=\\frac{2}{3}$, $n=4$, $X=0,1,2,3,4$",
     "urdu": "(i) یہاں $p=\\frac{1}{3}$، $q=\\frac{2}{3}$، $n=4$، $X=0,1,2,3,4$",
     "pashto": "(i) دلته $p=\\frac{1}{3}$، $q=\\frac{2}{3}$، $n=4$، $X=0,1,2,3,4$"
    },
    {
     "text": "$$p(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}{}^{4}_{x}C\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^x\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{4-x}, & x=0,1,2,3,4\\\\ 0, & \\textit{otherwise}\\end{matrix}\\right.$$",
     "urdu": "$$p(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}{}^{4}_{x}C\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^x\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{4-x}, & x=0,1,2,3,4\\\\ 0, & \\textit{otherwise}\\end{matrix}\\right.$$",
     "pashto": "$$p(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}{}^{4}_{x}C\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^x\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{4-x}, & x=0,1,2,3,4\\\\ 0, & \\textit{otherwise}\\end{matrix}\\right.$$"
    }
   ],
   "theory": "Example 3.13\n\nFind the mean, variance and standard deviation of the Binomial distribution whose parameters are n = 20 and p=\\frac{3}{5}.\n\nSolution:\n\nWe have n=20, p=\\frac{3}{5}, q=\\frac{2}{5}, therefore,\n\n\\text{Mean}=np=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}=12\n\n\\text{Variance}=npq=20\\times\\frac{3}{5}\\times\\frac{2}{5}=4.8\n\nS.D(X)=\\sqrt{npq}=\\sqrt{4.8}=2.19\n\nExample 3.14\n\nIf n = 4, p=\\frac{1}{3}, find (i) the complete Binomial probability distribution. (ii) mean and variance of this distribution. (iii) calculate the mean and variance using properties and compare the results.\n\nSolution:\n\n(i) Here p=\\frac{1}{3}, q=\\frac{2}{3}, n=4, X=0,1,2,3,4\n\n$p(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{matrix}{}^{4}_{x}C\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^x\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{4-x}, & x=0,1,2,3,4\\\\ 0, & \\textit{otherwise}\\end{matrix}\\right.$",
