     "text": "$=\\dfrac{1}{\\binom{N}{n}}\\sum_{x=1}^{n}x\\frac{k(k-1)!}{(k-x)!\\,x(x-1)!}\\binom{N-k}{n-x}$",
     "urdu": "$=\\dfrac{1}{\\binom{N}{n}}\\sum_{x=1}^{n}x\\frac{k(k-1)!}{(k-x)!\\,x(x-1)!}\\binom{N-k}{n-x}$",
     "pashto": "$=\\dfrac{1}{\\binom{N}{n}}\\sum_{x=1}^{n}x\\frac{k(k-1)!}{(k-x)!\\,x(x-1)!}\\binom{N-k}{n-x}$"
