     "pashto": "$(ii)\\quad P(3\\le X\\le 4)=\\int_3^4\\frac{1}{2}dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_3^4dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\left.x\\right|_3^4\\right]$"
