   "pashto": "(ii) د \\overline{X}_1-\\overline{X}_2 نمونوي وېش\n\n\\text{Now}\\quad\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)=\\frac{189}{81}=2.33\n\n\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)^2f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)-[\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)]^2}\n\n=\\sqrt{\\frac{504}{81}-\\left(\\frac{189}{81}\\right)^2}=\\sqrt{6.222-5.429}=\\sqrt{0.7931}=0.88\n\n(iii) تایید:\n\nد نفوس 1 منځنی او واریانس:\n\n\\mu_1=\\frac{3+4+5}{3}=\\frac{12}{3}=4\n\n\\sigma_1^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_1^2}{N_1}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_1}{N_1}\\right)^2=\\frac{50}{3}-\\left(\\frac{12}{3}\\right)^2=16.67-16=0.67\n\nد نفوس 2 منځنی او واریانس:\n\n\\mu_2=\\frac{1+1+3}{3}=\\frac{5}{3}=1.67\n\n\\sigma_2^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_2^2}{N_2}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_2}{N_2}\\right)^2=\\frac{11}{3}-\\left(\\frac{5}{3}\\right)^2=3.67-2.789=0.88\n\nد ځانګړنې له مخې:\n\n\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\mu_1-\\mu_2=4-1.67=2.33\n\n\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{0.67}{2}+\\frac{0.88}{2}}=\\sqrt{0.335+0.44}=0.775=0.88\n\nدا د محاسبه شویو پایلو سره یو شان دي.",
   "theoryUrdu": "(ii) \\overline{X}_1-\\overline{X}_2 کی نمونہ جاتی تقسیم\n\n\\text{Now}\\quad\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)=\\frac{189}{81}=2.33\n\n\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)^2f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)-[\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)]^2}\n\n=\\sqrt{\\frac{504}{81}-\\left(\\frac{189}{81}\\right)^2}=\\sqrt{6.222-5.429}=\\sqrt{0.7931}=0.88\n\n(iii) تصدیق:\n\nآبادی 1 کا اوسط اور تغیر:\n\n\\mu_1=\\frac{3+4+5}{3}=\\frac{12}{3}=4\n\n\\sigma_1^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_1^2}{N_1}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_1}{N_1}\\right)^2=\\frac{50}{3}-\\left(\\frac{12}{3}\\right)^2=16.67-16=0.67\n\nآبادی 2 کا اوسط اور تغیر:\n\n\\mu_2=\\frac{1+1+3}{3}=\\frac{5}{3}=1.67\n\n\\sigma_2^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_2^2}{N_2}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_2}{N_2}\\right)^2=\\frac{11}{3}-\\left(\\frac{5}{3}\\right)^2=3.67-2.789=0.88\n\nخاصیت کے مطابق:\n\n\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\mu_1-\\mu_2=4-1.67=2.33\n\n\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{0.67}{2}+\\frac{0.88}{2}}=\\sqrt{0.335+0.44}=0.775=0.88\n\nیہ معلوم کیے گئے نتائج کے برابر ہیں۔",
   "theoryPashto": "(ii) د \\overline{X}_1-\\overline{X}_2 نمونوي وېش\n\n\\text{Now}\\quad\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)=\\frac{189}{81}=2.33\n\n\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)^2f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)-[\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)]^2}\n\n=\\sqrt{\\frac{504}{81}-\\left(\\frac{189}{81}\\right)^2}=\\sqrt{6.222-5.429}=\\sqrt{0.7931}=0.88\n\n(iii) تایید:\n\nد نفوس 1 منځنی او واریانس:\n\n\\mu_1=\\frac{3+4+5}{3}=\\frac{12}{3}=4\n\n\\sigma_1^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_1^2}{N_1}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_1}{N_1}\\right)^2=\\frac{50}{3}-\\left(\\frac{12}{3}\\right)^2=16.67-16=0.67\n\nد نفوس 2 منځنی او واریانس:\n\n\\mu_2=\\frac{1+1+3}{3}=\\frac{5}{3}=1.67\n\n\\sigma_2^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_2^2}{N_2}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_2}{N_2}\\right)^2=\\frac{11}{3}-\\left(\\frac{5}{3}\\right)^2=3.67-2.789=0.88\n\nد ځانګړنې له مخې:\n\n\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\mu_1-\\mu_2=4-1.67=2.33\n\n\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{0.67}{2}+\\frac{0.88}{2}}=\\sqrt{0.335+0.44}=0.775=0.88\n\nدا د محاسبه شویو پایلو سره یو شان دي.",
   "content": "<p>(ii) The sampling distribution of \\overline{X}_1-\\overline{X}_2</p><p>\\text{Now}\\quad\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)=\\frac{189}{81}=2.33</p><p>\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)^2f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)-[\\Sigma(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)\\,f(\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2)]^2}</p><p>=\\sqrt{\\frac{504}{81}-\\left(\\frac{189}{81}\\right)^2}=\\sqrt{6.222-5.429}=\\sqrt{0.7931}=0.88</p><p>(iii) Verification:</p><p>Mean and variance of population 1:</p><p>\\mu_1=\\frac{3+4+5}{3}=\\frac{12}{3}=4</p><p>\\sigma_1^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_1^2}{N_1}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_1}{N_1}\\right)^2=\\frac{50}{3}-\\left(\\frac{12}{3}\\right)^2=16.67-16=0.67</p><p>Mean and variance of population 2:</p><p>\\mu_2=\\frac{1+1+3}{3}=\\frac{5}{3}=1.67</p><p>\\sigma_2^2=\\frac{\\Sigma x_2^2}{N_2}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma x_2}{N_2}\\right)^2=\\frac{11}{3}-\\left(\\frac{5}{3}\\right)^2=3.67-2.789=0.88</p><p>By property:</p><p>\\mu_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\mu_1-\\mu_2=4-1.67=2.33</p><p>\\sigma_{\\overline{x}_1-\\overline{x}_2}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\frac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{0.67}{2}+\\frac{0.88}{2}}=\\sqrt{0.335+0.44}=0.775=0.88</p><p>These are same as computed results.</p>",
   "translationStatus": "authored_aligned_paragraphs",
