     "urdu": "$(ii)\\ Var(\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2)=\\frac{p_1q_1}{n_1}\\frac{N_1-n_1}{N_1-1}+\\frac{p_2q_2}{n_2}\\frac{N_2-n_2}{N_2-1}$",
     "pashto": "$(ii)\\ Var(\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2)=\\frac{p_1q_1}{n_1}\\frac{N_1-n_1}{N_1-1}+\\frac{p_2q_2}{n_2}\\frac{N_2-n_2}{N_2-1}$"
