     "pashto": "د نفوس واریانس $\\sigma^2=\\frac{\\Sigma X^2}{N}-\\left(\\frac{\\Sigma X}{N}\\right)^2=\\frac{480}{4}-\\left(\\frac{40}{4}\\right)^2=20$"
