   "content": "<p>1-\\alpha=0.95,\\ \\alpha=0.05,\\ \\frac{\\alpha}{2}=0.025</p><p>From area table of normal distribution, we have Z_{\\alpha/2}=Z_{0.025}=1.96</p><p>Hence the 95% confidence interval for (\\mu_1-\\mu_2) is:</p><p>(75-73)\\pm 1.96\\sqrt{\\frac{64}{60}+\\frac{100}{100}}</p><p>2\\pm 1.96\\,(1.44)</p><p>2\\pm 2.8224</p><p>(-0.8224,\\ 4.8224)</p>",
