     "urdu": "$\\text{Now } \\overline{x}_1=\\frac{\\Sigma x_1}{n_1}=\\frac{492}{5}=98.4$",
     "pashto": "$\\text{Now } \\overline{x}_1=\\frac{\\Sigma x_1}{n_1}=\\frac{492}{5}=98.4$"
