     "urdu": "$(n_1-1)s_1^2=\\Sigma(x_1-\\overline{x}_1)^2=\\Sigma x_1^2-\\frac{(\\Sigma x_1)^2}{n_1}=48718-\\frac{(492)^2}{5}=305.2$",
     "pashto": "$(n_1-1)s_1^2=\\Sigma(x_1-\\overline{x}_1)^2=\\Sigma x_1^2-\\frac{(\\Sigma x_1)^2}{n_1}=48718-\\frac{(492)^2}{5}=305.2$"
