     "pashto": "$(n_2-1)s_2^2=\\Sigma(x_2-\\overline{x}_2)^2=\\Sigma x_2^2-\\frac{(\\Sigma x_2)^2}{n_2}=92019-\\frac{(775)^2}{7}=6215.4286$"
