     "pashto": "$$(\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2)\\pm Z_{\\alpha/2}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}_1\\hat{q}_1}{n_1}+\\frac{\\hat{p}_2\\hat{q}_2}{n_2}}$$"
