   "theoryPashto": "s_2^2=\\frac{1}{n_2-1}\\left[\\Sigma x_2^2-\\frac{(\\Sigma x_2)^2}{n_2}\\right]\n\n\\text{Or}\\ (n_2-1)s_2^2=\\Sigma x_2^2-\\frac{(\\Sigma x_2)^2}{n_2}=31707-\\frac{(551)^2}{10}=1346.9\n\n\\text{Now}\\quad s_p=\\sqrt{\\frac{(n_1-1)s_1^2+(n_2-1)s_2^2}{n_1+n_2-2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{754.9167+1346.9}{12+10-2}}\n\n=\\sqrt{\\frac{2101.8167}{20}}=10.25\n\n\\text{Hence } t=\\frac{(55.92-55.1)-0}{10.25\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac{1}{10}}}=\\frac{0.82}{4.3888}=0.187\n\nv. بحراني سیمه:\n\nموږ به H_0 رد کړو که t<t_{\\alpha/2,\\nu} یا t>t_{\\alpha/2,\\nu} په داسې حال کې چې\n\n$t_{\\alpha/2,\\nu}=t_{0.05/2,(12+10-2)}=t_{0.025,(20)}=2.086$\n\nvi. پایله:\n\nڅرنګه چې زموږ د t محاسبه شوی قیمت د منلو په سیمه کې پروت دی، نو H_0 منو.",
   "content": "<p>s_2^2=\\frac{1}{n_2-1}\\left[\\Sigma x_2^2-\\frac{(\\Sigma x_2)^2}{n_2}\\right]</p><p>\\text{Or}\\ (n_2-1)s_2^2=\\Sigma x_2^2-\\frac{(\\Sigma x_2)^2}{n_2}=31707-\\frac{(551)^2}{10}=1346.9</p><p>\\text{Now}\\quad s_p=\\sqrt{\\frac{(n_1-1)s_1^2+(n_2-1)s_2^2}{n_1+n_2-2}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{754.9167+1346.9}{12+10-2}}</p><p>=\\sqrt{\\frac{2101.8167}{20}}=10.25</p><p>\\text{Hence } t=\\frac{(55.92-55.1)-0}{10.25\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac{1}{10}}}=\\frac{0.82}{4.3888}=0.187</p><p>v. Critical region:</p><p>We will reject H_0 if t&lt;t_{\\alpha/2,\\nu} of t&gt;t_{\\alpha/2,\\nu} where as</p><p>$t_{\\alpha/2,\\nu}=t_{0.05/2,(12+10-2)}=t_{0.025,(20)}=2.086$</p><p>vi. Conclusion:</p><p>As our computed value of t lies in the acceptance region, therefore, we accept H_0.</p>",
