     "pashto": "$$Z=\\frac{(\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2)-(p_1-p_2)}{\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}_1\\hat{q}_1}{n_1}+\\frac{\\hat{p}_2\\hat{q}_2}{n_2}}}\\sim N(0,1)\\ \\text{under }H_0.$$"
