     "text": "$n_2=1000,\\ X_2=23,\\ \\hat{p}_2=\\frac{X_2}{n_2}=\\frac{23}{1000}=0.023$",
     "urdu": "$n_2=1000,\\ X_2=23,\\ \\hat{p}_2=\\frac{X_2}{n_2}=\\frac{23}{1000}=0.023$",
