     "urdu": "$\\text{Now}\\ \\hat{p}_c=\\frac{n_1\\hat{p}_1+n_2\\hat{p}_2}{n_1+n_2}=\\frac{52+23}{1000+1000}=\\frac{75}{2000}=0.0375$",
     "pashto": "$\\text{Now}\\ \\hat{p}_c=\\frac{n_1\\hat{p}_1+n_2\\hat{p}_2}{n_1+n_2}=\\frac{52+23}{1000+1000}=\\frac{75}{2000}=0.0375$"
