     "urdu": "$\\text{Hence } Z=\\frac{(0.052-0.023)-0}{\\sqrt{(0.0375)(0.9625)\\left(\\frac{1}{1000}+\\frac{1}{1000}\\right)}}=3.41$",
     "pashto": "$\\text{Hence } Z=\\frac{(0.052-0.023)-0}{\\sqrt{(0.0375)(0.9625)\\left(\\frac{1}{1000}+\\frac{1}{1000}\\right)}}=3.41$"
