     "text": "$$C=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\chi^2}{\\chi^2+n}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{46.994}{46.994+1100}}=\\sqrt{0.04097}=0.202$$",
     "urdu": "$$C=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\chi^2}{\\chi^2+n}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{46.994}{46.994+1100}}=\\sqrt{0.04097}=0.202$$",
     "pashto": "$$C=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\chi^2}{\\chi^2+n}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{46.994}{46.994+1100}}=\\sqrt{0.04097}=0.202$$"
